        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Sampler of linen canvas embroidered with brown and black silk in cross stitch with a little running stitch. The design shows a Greek Key border, within which are rows of alphabets and numerals of different sizes. It is backed with glazed cotton and the edges are bound with brown silk ribbon."@en , "Sampler of linen embroidered with brown silks by Margaret Dockray, England, 1829."@en ;
